<!--
    Native share-accounting controls.

    Cash is consolidated across offices because Fineract journal office_id is
    the office dimension. Bank accounts remain distinct payment channels. The
    reference fallback and purchase-approval suspense are control accounts
    whose reconciled balance must be zero.

    Empty tenants (sandbox) do not have Credesal's imported chart of accounts.
    0295-0 seeds the header ancestors required by 0295-1. Tenants that already
    have 111001, 125099, and 22200703 (production default) skip 0295-0.
-->
<databaseChangeLog xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
                   xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                   xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-4.3.xsd">

